# Copy to `.env` (gitignored). Only the web face reads these, at build time.
#
# The ecosystem's geo endpoint, used once per visit on the WEB face to SUGGEST a language (it is a
# question in a bar, never a switch). The key is a public site key — the same one the sites ship in
# their JavaScript — but it is configuration, not code, so it lives here. Leave it empty and the
# suggestion is simply never made.
VITE_GEO_API_KEY=
